| Author | Lines (share) | Counting blanks (share) | Last commit here | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Paul Borman | 95 (70.9%) | 111 (73.0%) | 2016-02-29 | inactive |
| MikeWang | 12 (9.0%) | 12 (7.9%) | 2023-11-24 | inactive |
| Alexander Rowe | 10 (7.5%) | 11 (7.2%) | 2025-02-18 | inactive here, but committed elsewhere in the repo on 2026-03-09 |
| Nicu Micle | 8 (6.0%) | 8 (5.3%) | 2024-11-14 | inactive |

- **Bus factor is 1 on both line counts.** That means one author, Paul Borman, holds over 50% of the lines.
- **The original author is gone.** Borman wrote most of it and last committed to the repo in 2016.
- **Best person to contact: Alexander Rowe.** They're the only author of this file still committing to the project, though they hold only 7.5% of it.
- **Ignore the "Normalize line endings" commit (`c50c42f`, Sam Okafor).** It touched every line but only changed whitespace, so Sam Okafor owns none of them.

