## SQL code

`sql.go` was renamed to `database_sql.go` in `cfc4a55`. The lines are still credited to the people who originally wrote them, not to whoever did the rename.

- **database_sql.go**, 48 lines (59 counting blanks), bus factor 2:
  - Justin Overfelt: 19 (39.6%) / 26 (44.1%)
  - Andrew Stone: 10 (20.8%) / 11 (18.6%)
  - David E. Wheeler: 7 (14.6%) / 8 (13.6%)
  - Daniel Souza: 6 (12.5%) / 8 (13.6%)
  - Paul Borman: 5 (10.4%) / 5 (8.5%)
